    "text": "<p>Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#956;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mi>&#955;</mi></mfenced><msup><mi>e</mi><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mi>t</mi></mfenced></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>&#956;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mi>t</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi><mi>H</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi>h</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mi>&#955;</mi></mfenced><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>h</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>&#956;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow><mi>h</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>(</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mi>&#955;</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>L</mi><mi>H</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mi>&#955;</mi></mfenced><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>h</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>&#956;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>(</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mi>&#955;</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>)</mo></math></p><p>Now,&nbsp;<math><mi>L</mi><mi>H</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>H</mi><mi>D</mi></math> if&nbsp;<math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>&#956;</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi></math></p>",
